  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add tomato paste and currants and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water (for the rice), basmati rice and a good pinch of salt. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove pan from heat. Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b805fc1830ec44f0fc/step-45379800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion and capsicum.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Trim green beans and slice into thirds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b805fc1830ec44f0fc/step-08297b10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion and capsicum with a pinch of salt, tossing, until softened, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a plate.\n• Return frying pan to high heat. Cook green beans and plant-based mince, breaking lamb up with a spoon, until browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• TIP: Drain the oil from the pan at the end of this step for the best results!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b805fc1830ec44f0fc/step-26a4d620.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium-high, then stir in Middle Eastern seasoning, the honey and garlic. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add vegetable stock powder and the water (for the veggie mince). Bring to a simmer and cook until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.\n• TIP: Add a splash more water to loosen the sauce, if needed!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b805fc1830ec44f0fc/step-a9a99e30.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the sauce is simmering, stir onion, capsicum and baby spinach leaves through the rice. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b805fc1830ec44f0fc/step-7443e940.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pilaf rice between bowls. Top with Moroccan-spiced plant-based mince.\n• Serve with Greek-style yoghurt. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185b805fc1830ec44f0fc/step-3dace950.jpeg"
    }
  ]
